1
00:00:00,632 --> 00:00:02,592
(Girl:)You're very funny. I'm Abby.

2
00:00:02,759 --> 00:00:04,469
(Sheldon:)-I'm Sheldon.
-How do you do?

3
00:00:04,636 --> 00:00:08,266
(Raj:)Rajesh Ramayan Koothrappali.
Call me Raj.

4
00:00:08,431 --> 00:00:11,931
-Hey, Raj. Where are you from?
-The mysterious subcontinent of India.

5
00:00:12,101 --> 00:00:13,981
(Abby:)-Ooh. India.
-You know India?

6
00:00:14,145 --> 00:00:19,445
(Abby:)-I saw Slumdog Millionaire.
-Well, I'm a slumdog astrophysicist.

7
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,440
(Sheldon:)I thought your father
was a gynecologist.

8
00:00:24,072 --> 00:00:25,862
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

9
00:00:28,701 --> 00:00:31,201
(Abby:)Martha, come here.
Meet Raj and Sheldon.

10
00:00:31,371 --> 00:00:32,621
(Abby:)-My friend Martha.
-Hi.

11
00:00:32,789 --> 00:00:33,869
(Raj:)-Hello.
-Hello.

12
00:00:34,082 --> 00:00:37,372
(Martha:)Is that the limited edition
Green Lantern lantern?

13
00:00:37,585 --> 00:00:43,635
(Sheldon:)In brightest day, in darkest night,
no evil shall escape my sight.

14
00:00:45,843 --> 00:00:48,513
(Martha:)Oh, that is so awesome.

15
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,810
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

16
